{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0232","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000000ff:text","row":31330,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"夜、日記を書いていると。","en":"That night, as I was writing in my journal—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802128","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00001","en":"At night, while writing the diary...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000137:text","row":31331,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“Hm?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802129","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Hm?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000157:text","row":31332,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"外から物音。","en":"A sound outside.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802130","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00003","en":"Sounds from the outside.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000024c:text","row":31333,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"蝋燭を消す。","en":"I blew out the candle.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802131","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00004","en":"I put out the candle,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000270:text","row":31334,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"窓際に。","en":"Went to the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802132","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00005","en":"and go to the window,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000290:text","row":31335,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"外を見る。","en":"Looked outside.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802133","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00006","en":"to look outside.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000383:text","row":31336,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"家の前、道路を誰かが歩いていた。","en":"Someone was walking along the road in front of the house.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802134","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00007","en":"Someone is walking in front of the house, in the street.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The Japanese past narrative says someone was walking along the road.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":18,"start":0,"text":"Someone is walking"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000003bb:text","row":31337,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"……霧。","en":"...Kiri.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802135","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00008","en":"...Kiri.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000003db:text","row":31338,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"荷物を抱えている。","en":"She was carrying a load of gear.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802136","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00009","en":"Holding a bag.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["undertranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"荷物 says she is carrying luggage or a load. The English narrows it to one bag without source support.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":13,"start":8,"text":"a bag"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000405:text","row":31339,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"日記のネタに飢えていたのだろうか。","en":"Maybe I was starved for journal material.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802137","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00010","en":"I guess I was starving for material for the diary, then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000043f:text","row":31340,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"好奇心がもたげた。","en":"My curiosity stirred.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802138","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00011","en":"My curiosity was piqued.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000469:text","row":31341,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"階下に。","en":"Downstairs.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802139","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00012","en":"To the lower floor.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"階下 means downstairs. 'The lower floor' is a literal spatial description rather than the movement destination.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":19,"start":0,"text":"To the lower floor."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000610:text","row":31342,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"遠くに霧の背中が『見え』る。","en":"Far ahead, I could ‘see’ Kiri's back.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802140","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00013","en":"Far in the distance I can... see... Kiri's back.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000644:text","row":31343,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"追った。","en":"I followed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802141","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00014","en":"I followed.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000664:text","row":31344,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"やがて町外れまで行くと、霧は荷物をおろした。","en":"At the edge of town, Kiri finally set down her load.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802142","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00015","en":"Before long we reach the outskirts, and Kiri laid down the bag.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000006a8:text","row":31345,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"俺は見つからないよう気配を殺し、近づく。","en":"I crept closer without making a sound, careful not to be seen.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802143","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00016","en":"I kill my presence as not to be seen, and close in.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","grammar"],"assessment":"気配を殺す means suppressing all sign of one's presence. The English exposes the Japanese metaphor and uses 'as not to' instead of 'so as not to.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":36,"start":0,"text":"I kill my presence as not to be seen"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000007c0:text","row":31346,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"クロスボウ―――","en":"A crossbow—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802144","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00017","en":"A crossbow---","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000007e8:text","row":31347,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"断じて玩具ではなかった。","en":"Most certainly not a toy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802145","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00018","en":"It was absolutely not a toy.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000818:text","row":31348,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"この国で手に入る、強力無比な武器だ。","en":"It was an extraordinarily powerful weapon, and one you could obtain in this country.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802146","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00019","en":"Coming into possession of that in this country means to have a weapon of power without compare.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","wrong_subject","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese calls it an incomparably powerful weapon obtainable in the country. The English makes acquisition the subject, turns description into a definition, and uses an awkward noun phrase for power.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":95,"start":0,"text":"Coming into possession of that in this country means to have a weapon of power without compare."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000854:text","row":31349,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"連射こそできないが。","en":"It could not fire in rapid succession, granted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802147","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00020","en":"It is not capable of rapid fire, but,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000880:text","row":31350,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"静音性に優れ、破壊力に富む。","en":"But it was quiet and devastating.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802148","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00021","en":"it has its edge in quietness, and is rich in destructive power.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says it excels in quiet operation and packs great destructive power. The English uses abstract calques for both qualities.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":62,"start":3,"text":"has its edge in quietness, and is rich in destructive power"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000008b4:text","row":31351,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"霧は引き金を引いた。","en":"Kiri pulled the trigger.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802149","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00022","en":"Kiri pulls the trigger.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The Japanese past narrative says Kiri pulled the trigger.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":22,"start":5,"text":"pulls the trigger"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000008e0:text","row":31352,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"枯れ木に矢が刺さった。","en":"The bolt buried itself in a dead tree.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802150","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00023","en":"A bolt pierced a withered old tree.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000090e:text","row":31353,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"風切り音が耳に残る。","en":"The whistle of its flight lingered in my ears.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802151","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00024","en":"The sound of slashed air remains in the ears.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"風切り音 is the whistle or rush of the projectile cutting through air, and the sound remains in Taichi's ears. The English turns the air into something already slashed and omits the possessor.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":4,"text":"sound of slashed air remains in the ears"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000093a:text","row":31354,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"霧は新しい矢をつがえる。","en":"Kiri fitted another bolt.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802152","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00025","en":"Kiri nocks a new bolt.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000096a:text","row":31355,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"コッキング装置で、装填を済ませる。","en":"She used the cocking mechanism to finish loading it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802153","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00026","en":"She completes the load via the crank cocking aid.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000009a4:text","row":31356,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"ぎこちない。","en":"Clumsy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802154","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00027","en":"Awkwardly.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","wrong_subject"],"assessment":"The Japanese adjective says her handling is awkward. The English adverb has no verb or action to modify.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":10,"start":0,"text":"Awkwardly."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000009c8:text","row":31357,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"が、知っていた。","en":"But I knew what it was.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802155","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00028","en":"But... I knew:","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000009f0:text","row":31358,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"これは訓練だ。","en":"This was training.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802156","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00029","en":"This is practice.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000a16:text","row":31359,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"戦うための。","en":"Training to fight.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802157","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00030","en":"For combat.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000a3a:text","row":31360,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"では、誰と。","en":"But against whom?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802158","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00031","en":"Well then, who with?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The training is for fighting, so 誰と asks against whom. 'With whom' can instead imply cooperation.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":20,"start":11,"text":"who with?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000a5e:text","row":31361,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"誰と……だろう……。","en":"Who was she going to fight...?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802159","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00032","en":"Who with... indeed...","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese continues wondering whom she intends to fight. 'With' again obscures the adversarial role, while 'indeed' changes uncertainty into affirmation.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":21,"start":0,"text":"Who with... indeed..."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000a8a:text","row":31362,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"背筋につららがさしこまれた。","en":"An icicle slid down my spine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802160","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00033","en":"An icicle was thrust into my spinal column.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000acb:text","row":31363,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「……っ」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802161","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00034","en":"Taichi: \"...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000b12:text","row":31364,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「し」","en":"“Shh.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802162","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00035","en":"Youko: \"Shhh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000b30:text","row":31365,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"動作が跳ね上がりかけた矢先、絶妙のタイミングで肩を押さえられた。","en":"Just as I was about to spring upright, a hand pressed my shoulder at precisely the right moment.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802163","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00036","en":"Just on the arrowtip of being about to leap into a rash motion, I was pushed down on the shoulder with a miraculous timing.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","mistranslation","addition"],"assessment":"Just as Taichi is about to jump, a hand presses his shoulder at exactly the right moment. The English literalizes 矢先 as an arrowtip, changes restraint to being pushed down, and makes the timing miraculous.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":123,"start":0,"text":"Just on the arrowtip of being about to leap into a rash motion, I was pushed down on the shoulder with a miraculous timing."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000b88:text","row":31366,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"すとん、と。","en":"I sank straight down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802164","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00037","en":"Thump, straight down.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000bac:text","row":31367,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"膝から力が抜けた。","en":"The strength drained from my knees.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802165","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00038","en":"Power was removed from the knees.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","wrong_subject"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the strength goes out of Taichi's knees. The English makes abstract power something passively removed from detached body parts.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":33,"start":0,"text":"Power was removed from the knees."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000caf:text","row":31368,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ょぅ……」","en":"“...Yo—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802166","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00039","en":"Taichi: \"...You...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000cfc:text","row":31369,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「静かに」","en":"“Quiet.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802167","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00040","en":"Youko: \"Quiet.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000d1e:text","row":31370,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"深呼吸一つして、冷静さを取り戻す。","en":"I took one deep breath and recovered my composure.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802168","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00041","en":"Taking a single deep breath, I regain my composure.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000d58:text","row":31371,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"小声で話しかける。","en":"Then I spoke in a whisper.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802169","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00042","en":"I talk to her in a low voice.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000d8a:text","row":31372,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうしてここに？」","en":"“Why are you here?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802170","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00043","en":"Taichi: \"Why are you here?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000ddb:text","row":31373,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一と同じ」","en":"“Same reason you are.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802171","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00044","en":"Youko: \"Same as Taichi.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000e01:text","row":31374,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"霧の挙動に気づいたのか。","en":"Had she noticed Kiri acting strangely too?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802172","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00045","en":"She took notice of Kiri's behavior perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000e56:text","row":31375,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「毎日やっているみたい」","en":"“It looks like she does this every day.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802173","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00046","en":"Youko: \"Seems to do this every day.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","omission"],"assessment":"The Japanese says Kiri apparently practices every day. The English omits the grammatical subject.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":35,"start":8,"text":"Seems to do this every day."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000e8e:text","row":31376,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「……アレはどこから手に入れたの？」","en":"“...Where did she get that thing?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802174","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00047","en":"Taichi: \"...how did she even come into that thing?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese asks where she obtained it. 'Come into that thing' is not the English acquisition construction.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":50,"start":12,"text":"how did she even come into that thing?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000eef:text","row":31377,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「マニア」","en":"“A collector.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802175","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00048","en":"Youko: \"Enthusiasts.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000f19:text","row":31378,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、ありそう……」","en":"“Oh. Figures...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802176","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00049","en":"Taichi: \"Ahhh, that's likely.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000f47:text","row":31379,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"金さえあれば比較的容易に購入できる。","en":"Apparently they weren't hard to buy, if you had the money.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802177","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00050","en":"If one has but money, it's comparatively easy to procure one.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000f83:text","row":31380,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"霧はそれから、しばらく訓練を続けた。","en":"Kiri kept training for a while.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802178","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00051","en":"After that, Kiri continued practice for a while.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00000fe4:text","row":31381,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「……取ってほしい？」","en":"“...Want me to take it away?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802179","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00052","en":"Youko: \"...want it removed?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001012:text","row":31382,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"唐突な言葉。","en":"The words came out of nowhere.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802180","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00053","en":"Sudden words.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001036:text","row":31383,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"定期的な風切り音の合間、静寂に吸い取られる。","en":"Between the regular hiss of bolts, the silence swallowed them whole.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802181","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00054","en":"They are absorbed into the still quietness in the intervals between the periodic sound of slashed air.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese refers to the regular whistle or rush of bolts cutting the air. 'Slashed air' is a literalized result rather than the sound event.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":101,"start":68,"text":"the periodic sound of slashed air"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000107a:text","row":31384,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"ただ耳の中には、いつまでも残った。","en":"But they stayed in my ears.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802182","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00055","en":"But inside my ears, they linger for a long time,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000010b4:text","row":31385,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"ぞっとするような意味をともなって。","en":"Together with their chilling implication.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802183","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00056","en":"together with their horrifying meaning.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001161:text","row":31386,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"『太一……取ってほしい？』","en":"‘Taichi... want me to take it away?’","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802184","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00057","en":"Youko: 『Taichi... want it removed?』","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000011d6:text","row":31387,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"『取ってあげるわ』","en":"‘I'll take it away for you.’","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802185","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00058","en":"Youko: 『I will remove it for you, yes.』","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001255:text","row":31388,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「取るって……」","en":"“Take it away...?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802186","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00059","en":"Taichi: \"Remove, you say...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000012a2:text","row":31389,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一が望むなら」","en":"“If that's what you want.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802187","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00060","en":"Youko: \"If you wish it, Taichi.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000012d4:text","row":31390,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「望まない」","en":"“I don't.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802188","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00061","en":"Taichi: \"I don't wish it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000131d:text","row":31391,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも……」","en":"“But...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802189","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00062","en":"Youko: \"But...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001341:text","row":31392,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"睨みつける。","en":"I glared at her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802190","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00063","en":"I glare at her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000136d:text","row":31393,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺の言うことをきいてくれるなら、何もしないでくれ」","en":"“If you'll do as I ask, then don't do anything.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802191","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00064","en":"Taichi: \"If you intend to do what I tell you to do, then you will do nothing.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000013de:text","row":31394,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わかったわ」","en":"“...All right.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802192","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00065","en":"Youko: \"...got it, yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001408:text","row":31395,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"心なしか肩を落とす。","en":"Her shoulders seemed to droop.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802193","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00066","en":"She gives a somewhat discouraged drop of the shoulders.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese says her shoulders seem to droop slightly. The English nominalizes the motion as a drop that she gives.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":54,"start":4,"text":"gives a somewhat discouraged drop of the shoulders"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000143c:text","row":31396,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「曜子ちゃんだって、人間だろ……同じ、人間なんだ」","en":"“You're human too, Youko... We're the same. We're human.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802194","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00067","en":"Taichi: \"Youko-chan, even you are human... the same, human.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["logical_relation","word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000148e:text","row":31397,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802195","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00068","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000014ba:text","row":31398,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「少なくとも俺と一緒なら、半分は人間だろ」","en":"“At least when you're with me, that makes you half human.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802196","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00069","en":"Taichi: \"At least as far as you are together with me, half of you will be human.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001521:text","row":31399,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「私は」","en":"“I...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802197","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00070","en":"Youko: \"To me,\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001566:text","row":31400,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「私は太一が人だとは思ってないもの」","en":"“I don't think you're human, Taichi.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802198","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00071","en":"Youko: \"To me Taichi is someone I cannot think of as a person.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000015c7:text","row":31401,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一は太一。私にはそれで十分。そして私も私。二人で一人」","en":"“You're Taichi. That's enough for me. And I'm me. Together, we make one.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802199","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00072","en":"Youko: \"Taichi is nothing more than Taichi. To me that is adequate. And I am also no more than I am. Two that make one.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","undertranslation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000163e:text","row":31402,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"「はんぶんこ」","en":"“Halfsies.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802200","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00073","en":"Youko: \"Halves.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000166c:text","row":31403,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「……婚約者だろ」","en":"“...We're engaged, aren't we?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802201","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00074","en":"Taichi: \"...like fiancees, right?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["name_address","addition","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Taichi says they are an engaged couple. 'Fiancees' denotes two women, and 'like' weakens the asserted relationship into comparison.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":25,"start":12,"text":"like fiancees"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001696:text","row":31404,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"微笑む。","en":"She smiled.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802202","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00075","en":"She smiles.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000016db:text","row":31405,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう、婚約者」","en":"“Yes. Engaged.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802203","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00076","en":"Youko: \"Yes, fiancees.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["name_address","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The two-person mixed-gender engaged relationship cannot be denoted by the female plural 'fiancees.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":21,"start":13,"text":"fiancees"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001703:text","row":31406,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"たまの笑顔は童女のようにあどけないのに。","en":"And yet, when she did smile, it was with the innocence of a little girl.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802204","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00077","en":"That rare smile of hers is as cherubic as a little girl's, but,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001743:text","row":31407,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"どうして―――","en":"So why—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802205","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00078","en":"why---","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001769:text","row":31408,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"悲嘆が心を塗りつぶす前に、霧が動いた。","en":"Before grief could paint over my heart, Kiri moved.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802206","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00079","en":"Before grief could paint over the heart, Kiri had moved.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The Japanese gives Kiri's movement as the next event before grief overwhelms him. Past perfect incorrectly places it before the established narrative point.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":55,"start":41,"text":"Kiri had moved"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000017a7:text","row":31409,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"撃ち尽くした矢を回収する。","en":"She collected the bolts she had fired.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802207","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00080","en":"She recovered her exhausted supply of fired bolts,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000017d9:text","row":31410,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"そして再び撃つ。","en":"Then fired them again.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802208","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00081","en":"and then fired them once again.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001801:text","row":31411,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"三巡して、霧は訓練を追えた。","en":"After three rounds, Kiri finished her training.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802209","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00082","en":"Three rounds later, Kiri has finished with practice.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The surrounding past narration says Kiri finished her practice after three cycles. Present perfect shifts the temporal frame.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":51,"start":25,"text":"has finished with practice"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000185a:text","row":31412,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"「あの腕ならよほど至近距離で狙われない限り、平気だと思う」","en":"“At her skill level, I think you'll be safe unless she gets close enough to shoot you point-blank.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802210","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00083","en":"Youko: \"With that skill, as long as she is not aiming point-blank we'll be alright, I think.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000018b4:text","row":31413,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"「そういう状況になってほしくないんだけど……」","en":"“I'd rather it never came to that...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802211","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00084","en":"Taichi: \"But I don't want things to get to that point...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000018fa:text","row":31414,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"不意に祠のことを思い出した。","en":"Suddenly, I remembered the shrine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802212","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00085","en":"Suddenly, I remembered about the hokora.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001936:text","row":31415,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"「ねえ、曜子ちゃん、祠のこと知ってる？」","en":"“Hey, Youko. Do you know about the shrine?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802213","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00086","en":"Taichi: \"Say, Youko-chan, you know about the hokora?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:0000199b:text","row":31416,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"「……知ってる」","en":"“...I do.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802214","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00087","en":"Youko: \"...I know.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:000019cb:text","row":31417,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"「この世界が……」","en":"“This world...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802215","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00088","en":"Taichi: \"This world's---\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001a1a:text","row":31418,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"「情報不足」","en":"“Insufficient information.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802216","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00089","en":"Youko: \"Insufficient data.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001a3e:text","row":31419,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"ぴしゃりと、言葉を打ち切る。","en":"She cut me off cold.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802217","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00090","en":"She flatly cuts off my words.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001a97:text","row":31420,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"「早計するための知恵じゃない」","en":"“Wisdom isn’t meant for jumping to conclusions.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802218","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00091","en":"Youko: \"Wisdom is to not make rash conclusions.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese says wisdom is not meant for jumping to conclusions. The English splits the infinitive after a copula and turns the governing purpose into an awkward identity.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":8,"text":"Wisdom is to not make rash conclusions."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001ad5:text","row":31421,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも」","en":"“But—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802219","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00092","en":"Taichi: \"But!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001b1a:text","row":31422,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"「仮に世界が繰り返されているとするなら、今論じる必要はないと思う」","en":"“Supposing the world is repeating itself, I see no need to discuss it now.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802220","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00093","en":"Youko: \"Even if, provisionally, we take that the world is made to repeat itself, there is no need to discuss it now, I think.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","grammar","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese gives one hypothetical condition: if the world is repeating. The English redundantly stacks 'even if' and 'provisionally' and introduces an external agent making it repeat.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":79,"start":8,"text":"Even if, provisionally, we take that the world is made to repeat itself"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001b7c:text","row":31423,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802221","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00094","en":"Taichi: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001ba0:text","row":31424,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"押し黙る。","en":"I fell silent.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802222","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00095","en":"She keeps silent.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says Taichi falls silent in response to Youko. The English assigns the silence to Youko.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":17,"start":0,"text":"She keeps silent."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001bc2:text","row":31425,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女が言うのなら、そうなのだろう。","en":"If she said so, she was probably right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802223","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00096","en":"If she says so, then it is likely so.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001bfc:text","row":31426,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"支倉曜子はいつだって的確だ。","en":"Youko Hasekura always got things exactly right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802224","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00097","en":"Hasekura Youko is always accurate.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001c30:text","row":31427,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"霧が引き上げた。","en":"Kiri left.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802225","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00098","en":"Kiri packed up and left.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001c58:text","row":31428,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"もう追跡する必要はなかった。","en":"There was no reason to follow her anymore.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802226","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00099","en":"There is no need to pursue more.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","undertranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says there is no longer any need to follow her. 'Pursue' can imply hunting or attacking and 'more' does not express the temporal cessation.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":31,"start":9,"text":"no need to pursue more"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001c8c:text","row":31429,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"平原に出て、的になっていた樹を調べる。","en":"I stepped out onto the plain and examined the tree she had used as a target.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802227","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00100","en":"Coming out into the open space, I examine the timber that was turned target.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","grammar","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese says he examines the tree used as a target. 'Timber' denotes wood as material, and the English omits 'into a' from its transformation construction.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":75,"start":42,"text":"the timber that was turned target"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001cd7:text","row":31430,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802228","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00101","en":"Taichi: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001d20:text","row":31431,"ordinal":102,"kind":"text","jp":"「……太一」","en":"“...Taichi.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802229","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00102","en":"Youko: \"...Taichi.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001d4c:text","row":31432,"ordinal":103,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいんだ」","en":"“It's all right.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802230","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00103","en":"Taichi: \"It's OK.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0232:00001e33:text","row":31433,"ordinal":104,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいんだ……」","en":"“It's all right...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:802231","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3005:00104","en":"Taichi: \"It's OK...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
